# Trivy findings to ignore.
#
# Format: one CVE per line (e.g. `CVE-2023-12345`) or a misconfig rule ID
# (e.g. `AVD-DS-0002`). Each entry MUST carry a dated justification comment
# explaining why it's accepted. Remove entries once the underlying issue is
# remediated (e.g. a dep upgrade lands).
#
# Starting empty on purpose — the first Trivy run will populate the initial
# triage list. Any additions here should link to:
#   - an upstream advisory URL
#   - a short note on impact assessment
#   - an expected remediation date or a "won't-fix" rationale
